Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:04.48,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历杭德罗 达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:11.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}claims a maiden Masters 1000 title in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在上海夺得生涯首座大师赛冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:14.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 第二盘又被破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:16.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}福基纳却从这样的开局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}拿到了第一座大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:22.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这场逆转 究竟是从哪一分开始的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}日下午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.28,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}上海大师赛男单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:30.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}达维多维奇 福基纳 对阵霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:33.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一场西班牙球员的冠军争夺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:49.37,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Brilliant start,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开局精彩！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.37,0:00:55.25,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and an early break for the 20-year-old,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位二十岁的小将率先破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:58.81,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}appreciated by the two-time former champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两届赛会冠军也为他鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.69,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There is again the drop shot,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是一记放短
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:04.79,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but this is exquisite.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N处理得真是精妙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:34.97,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's well done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球处理得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:37.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.41,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}前一天刚淘汰梅德韦杰夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:43.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘的底线拉锯 他占了上风
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:46.74,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}次超过九拍的长回合 他全部拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:49.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两个破发点 也都兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:20.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sensational!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:26.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a second break is secured.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N再度完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:43.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a flawless set of tennis{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘打得无可挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:45.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six games to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:47.84,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Rafael Jodar.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拉斐尔 霍达尔的表现太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.22,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Outrageous!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N简直不可思议！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:09.50,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好球！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.64,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Don't forget about me,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N“别忘了 我还在！”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:15.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}says Davidovich Fokina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳用表现作出了回应
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:25.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A disappointing end to the game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一局的收尾令人失望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}更难的是 第二盘来到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他又丢了发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:33.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}已经落后一盘 还要再追一个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:37.15,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}冠军还很远 先要把比赛留住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that is remarkable!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 太不可思议了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:56.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a chase from Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳这次追球太惊人了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:04:02.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to get his first break of the match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了本场第一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:06.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The nuclear athleticism{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这种惊人的运动能力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:09.02,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that is so often associated with this guy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N正是这位球员一贯的特点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.78,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}从底线追到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}倒地也要把球救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:16.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这个回破 福基纳靠的是再多打一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}但追平还不够 随后{\fs78}3{\fs68}个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.99,0:04:22.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他又把{\fs78}5{\fs68}个破发点全部救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:39.72,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Great point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N精彩的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:53.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jaw-dropping!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N令人瞠目结舌！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How good that is!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球打得太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:00.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Right on cue.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来得正是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.92,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What an effort,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么顽强的拼搏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:25.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}once again from Davidovich Fokina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳再一次做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:29.40,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Down a set and a break in the final in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N上海决赛 他曾落后一盘和一个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:51.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's punished him.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球给了对手有力回击
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This time he converts.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次 他兑现了破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.52,0:06:05.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}双方来到抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:06.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}前{\fs78}10{\fs68}个小分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:09.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}各自守住发球分 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:11.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}福基纳终于抢到接发分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:12.58,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}随后再拿一分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:14.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:17.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘拿下 冠军的争夺 还要继续
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘 福基纳先破发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:34.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可下一局就被回破
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:37.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}双方又回到同一起跑线
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.17,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}好不容易抢来的主动 又被追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:42.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}要赢 他还得再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.85,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A second break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:25.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 他再次完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 这次他把领先守住了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:31.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}霍达尔仍在追 比赛也没有立刻结束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:35.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后这几个发球局 一个都不能松
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.27,0:07:58.01,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一局结束
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}从首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 到抢七扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.72,0:08:30.23,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}再到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}的发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}福基纳终于把冠军的决定权
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.81,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}握回自己的发球里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.05,0:09:02.33,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:05.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历杭德罗 达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:12.49,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}claims a maiden Masters 1000 title in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在上海夺得生涯首座大师赛冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:20.37,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A week where he has proved his resilience.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 他证明了自己的坚韧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.69,0:09:27.77,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He has worked his way through so many difficult situations,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他闯过了一个又一个艰难关口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.23,0:09:31.99,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but it's a third title of the season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最终拿下了本赛季第三个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:34.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:36.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两个多小时之后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.14,0:09:37.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:39.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}上海大师赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:48.38,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}背伤曾让他缺赛两个月
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:51.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}9{\fs68}月下旬 他在成都回归就夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:54.03,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}不到一个月 又在上海捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:57.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}从成都到上海 中国赛场{\fs78}10{\fs68}连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:58.17,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}回归以后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:01.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他拿到了生涯级别最高的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:04.05,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘只赢一局的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后赢下了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:09.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这场逆转里 哪一分最让你相信
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他真的能赢？
